=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9238017262/original/s_Wp8Chgya8lkZicG3pEbOmkBzcEliSU4w.png?1759397663\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9238017262\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You can also switch between clients easily by clicking the menu icon (three lines in the top left corner). Then, click on the client’s name at the top to open a dropdown list of all your clients. Simply select a client from the list to access their account.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9238019590/original/MlJoNkncPc_9lYi2-M6AQcL61IC03F_gkQ.png?1759400726\" style=\"width: 233px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9238019590\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000271417\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000271417/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voti